        "spawn(file: string, args?: string[] | null, opts?: SpawnOptions): Subprocess",
        "spawn(file: string, opts?: SpawnOptions): Subprocess"
      ],
      "description": "Spawn `file` as a new subprocess with the given `args`. Returns a `Subprocess` instance. `args` may be `null` or omitted to spawn with no arguments. If `args` is omitted, the second argument is treated as `options`.",
